  Variables (lo size msz a sha sht size8 TSD CTX TH pa nres nch : Z) (sbs1 sbs3 : list byte).
  Hypothesis DEFS : hidden (msz = round_up size 4096 + 4096 /\ sha = sh a /\ sht = sh (a + 4096 + size)).
